{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1633","id":4089298641,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87zvb7R","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1633","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1633.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1633.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1633","number":1633,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(storage): reconcile 9709 QP–MS completeness and source authority","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Phase C0/C1 authority verdict\n\n- Rebased base SHA: `f82d2adf404b25dd83b3b56672b28141c4bb4483`\n- Rebased head SHA: `7b02345a4e9138710d72db7c42eb01a61ba58946`\n- Human-approved target scope: all actually administered regular 9709 QP/MS in March, May/June, and October/November from 2016 through 2025.\n- 2026 scope: explicitly withdrawn by Samsen. No `s26` QP/MS was acquired, registered, or counted.\n- `TARGET_SCOPE_AUTHORITY=FROZEN_BY_SAMSEN`\n- `TARGET_SCOPE_COMPLETENESS=ESTABLISHED`\n- Final canonical counts: 459 QP + 459 MS = 918 documents and 459 complete pairs.\n- QP-only: 0; MS-only: 0; missing-both: 0; ambiguous identities: 0; parse failures: 0.\n- Duplicate exclusion: 1 (`9709_w21_ms_12(1).pdf`), machine-verified as the annotated personal copy; the clean canonical file remains unchanged.\n- Visible-red watermark blockers: 0. The prior 80 replacements remain provenance-bound and validated.\n- `FULL_UPLOAD_INVENTORY_AUTHORITY=FROZEN`\n- `FULL_BATCH_UPLOAD_AUTHORIZED=false`\n\nInventory authority is frozen; actual upload authorization remains a separate fail-closed human gate.\n\n## Rebase custody\n\n- Safely rebased the existing three commits onto current `origin/main` without conflicts.\n- Pre/post rebase acquisition receipt SHA-256: `88bac3ce25e0fb1c3a0555f441e3653e9b14156adb4f6aed3d9fee66c844e3a5`.\n- Pre/post rebase watermark receipt SHA-256: `f7c740669f25d62b26613ba7e8be5c661d85f59b635c6a49a9489c6c411daf6c`.\n- Pre/post rebase canonical-freeze SHA-256: `173832334a8e3d5af7567336cb63ab0d26630d95dbf6d07c34c741bdff877f1d`.\n- Pre/post rebase target-scope SHA-256: `f66253920c37e2d268a639ddacb3b1d65f01a76dd42f5b0e94784e90a18193eb`.\n- PDF diff against rebased base: exactly 27 added acquisition PDFs, 80 modified watermark-remediation PDFs, 0 deleted PDFs.\n- Acquisition path-set delta: 0; watermark-receipt path-set delta: 0; `s26` PDF count: 0.\n\n## Source hierarchy and acquisitions\n\n- Historical pairing acquisitions: 27 Paper 7 QPs from the repository-approved mirror chain, each with source URL, HTTP evidence, SHA-256, size, page count, PDF magic, first-page identity validation, no-overwrite, temporary cleanup, and atomic rename receipt.\n- Historical watermark remediation: 80 QualifiedQuest replacements (36 QP + 44 MS), with pre/post hashes, exact paths, all-page render replay, annotation inventory, and source receipts.\n- Mirror-derived files retain `official_byte_authority_established=false`, `rights_cleared=false`, and `governance_status=source_present_unreviewed`.\n\n## Review findings resolved\n\n- Legacy SourceDocument registry and the other five legacy/OSS surfaces bootstrap safely when absent.\n- Machine-specific `/home/samsen/.../node_modules` fallbacks are removed.\n- External `curl` is replaced with portable bounded native `fetch` with HTTPS allowlists, final redirect-host validation, timeout, HTTP/body-size safeguards, and receipt fields.\n- All five review threads remain resolved.\n\n## Living artifacts\n\n- Adds `v1-9709-target-scope-authority.json`.\n- Refreshes pairing, gap, official-expected, acquisition-plan, canonical-freeze, exclusions, OSS candidate, planned manifest, offline validator, authority audit, input contract, local readback receipt, human report, and report index.\n- OSS candidate inventory contains 918 unique rows/object keys and carries Samsen's frozen inventory authority.\n- Planned object manifest contains 918 rows and remains `upload_authorized=false`.\n- No extraction-ready, scoring-ready, student-visible, rights-cleared, production-ready, or launch-ready claim is made.\n\n## Post-rebase verification\n\n- `storage:9709-completeness:test` — PASS, 18/18.\n- `storage:9709-completeness:write` / `check` — PASS and repeatable; semantic SHA `bc4f3757aa036b14541783b42b743346940caf0bed591eb94269c8f4c83a47e7`.\n- `storage:9709-watermark:check` — PASS, 80/80 all-page replay.\n- `storage:aliyun-oss-offline:test` — PASS, 19/19.\n- `storage:aliyun-oss-offline:write` / `check` — PASS and repeatable; semantic SHA `2df9ce068949436dbc0949f77fc3e86bb98f5788a8c4897c691413940695e3f9`.\n- Targeted ESLint, JSON parse, `quality:report-index`, credential scan, absolute-path guard, `.worktrees` guard, temporary-file guard, PDF custody guard, and `git diff --check` — PASS.\n\n## Parent Creation Gate evidence\n\nThe Parent Creation Gate is triggered by pre-existing `package.json`/9709 workflow paths, not by the storage source files in this PR.\n\nClean-main reproduction at exact `origin/main=f82d2adf404b25dd83b3b56672b28141c4bb4483`:\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/build_9709_campaign_a_parent_creation_contracts_v1.py --check` — PASS, 31 artifacts.\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/validate_9709_campaign_a_parent_creation_gate_contract_v1.py` — exit 1 on clean main.\n- Exact clean-main blocker: `independent_review_receipt_present_but_invalid`, including `independent_review_acl_mirror_probe_bundle_hash_mismatch`, `independent_review_acl_runtime_bundle_hash_mismatch`, unrelated artifact/inventory mismatches, and `independent_review_stale_bundle_hash`.\n- Clean main also has no `pytest` executable and `python3 -m pytest --version` reports `No module named pytest`; prior self-hosted CI logs show the runner installs into user-site but invokes bare `pytest`, which is absent from PATH and exits 127.\n\nThese are independently reproduced main/infrastructure failures. This storage PR does not change the shared workflow and does not represent them as green.\n\n## Zero project-cloud operations\n\n- OSS API calls: 0\n- RAM operations: 0\n- AccessKeys read/created: 0\n- Supabase mutations: 0\n- CDN operations: 0\n- uploads: 0\n- protected cloud remote reads: 0\n\nThis PR remains Draft. Do not merge, enable auto-merge, or mark Ready before Samsen and independent GPT-5.6 Pro review.\n","created_at":"2026-07-20T07:57:04Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T07:19:52Z","closed_at":"2026-07-21T07:19:52Z","merged_at":"2026-07-21T07:19:52Z","merge_commit_sha":"347056ee6d89598947020603a8dcdcbdd64e0c6e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1633/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1633/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1633/comments","statuses_url":"https:/